{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id85767017"}, "name":{"label":"Jessica :)!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-09T15:05:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"14530793159"}, "title":{"label":"It’s a Trap"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this because I lead a busy life and want to make room for what’s important and stay on track. I downloaded this because I needed the structure it promised. I did the free trial, and continued with the subscription plan. For about a week, the alerts helped me stay on track. HOWEVER, after that first week, I stopped getting alerts. It took some time for me to figure that out. I still am not getting notified, and I have already been charged for the year. Not reliable for its intended use. It was challenging to customize at first, but was able to learn through the videos on YouTube before its complete failure. Will be deleting and hope to warn anyone else before they purchase. Might as well go back to ole reliable reminders provided free by Apple.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
