{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id879983632"}, "name":{"label":"Macbook app is buggy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-07T07:42:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"14521643166"}, "title":{"label":"laptop app is buggy"}, "content":{"label":"iphone app works great. usually works well on ipad too. however, the structured app downloaded onto my macbook is buggy. doesnt let me type seamlessly and constantly glitches. i often have to re-rype the title of event event multiple times and severely reduces my likelihood to use the app for the purpose it was intended. if mac app bugs are fixed, this app is a dream!! please fix!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37384182"}, "name":{"label":"cackalacki"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-07T01:44:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"14520638667"}, "title":{"label":"I LOVE This App, but the Inbox Is HORRIBLY PAINFUL! Please end the suffering!"}, "content":{"label":"I absolutely love this app except for one thing: The Inbox.\n\nIf it wasn’t for the inbox, I would give this app five stars. In fact, I would give it more if I could.\n\nThe Inbox is so painful to use on a tablet and especially on a phone if you have a lot of items sitting there that you haven’t scheduled yet. And isn’t that the whole point of an inbox? I put things there because I know I need to do them, I don’t want to forget them, but I don’t necessarily know yet when I’m going to do them.\n\nI currently have around 20 things in my Inbox, and trying to organize them is incredibly frustrating. You have to press and hold each task and drag it where you want it. But if you’re trying to move something farther up the list, once you reach the top of the screen, IT DOESN’T KEEP SCROLLING. It just stops. So you have to let go of the task, scroll the list to make more room at the top, find the task again, drag it farther up, and keep repeating this process.\n\nWhy???\n\nThere’s also no way to filter or sort the Inbox by category, which would at least make managing a larger Inbox easier.\n\nWhat frustrates me so much is that I genuinely LOVE this app. I have a lot of plates spinning in my life, with both big and little things I need to remember, and Structured is exactly the kind of app I need. But I’m starting to wonder if the Inbox is actually helping me manage all of those things or just giving me another frustrating list that I have to manage.\n\nPlease fix this user experience. At the very least, tasks should continuously scroll when you drag them to the top or bottom of the screen. Even better, give us ways to sort, filter, group, or otherwise organize the Inbox.\n\nI design software, so I understand that development takes time and priorities have to be made. But this feels like such a fundamental usability issue in a core part of the app. Please make it a priority.\n\nI really don’t want to stop using Structured because I love almost everything else about it. But the Inbox is making me want to.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
