{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id192684864"}, "name":{"label":"@lifeisartreality"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-22T13:13:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"14460003117"}, "title":{"label":"📔🔖Always appreciate when app developers\nlisten. Betta testing new task suggestions"}, "content":{"label":"The betta features for task suggestion work way better with voice over screen reader on iphone. Typing  Sub tasks are getting there.\n\n As a blind ADHD user, what stood out most for me is the intuitive interface, lock screen, and home screen, widgets, and control center control buttons, but especially the   sound per task feature, where each task can have a different sound. Perfect way of staying on task without having to look at the screen. Structured AI also helps me organize and plan based on what the camera sees. I’ve been integrating with Google Calendar, using Gemini as a workaround to continue to integrate, structured. It will be cool to grow into learning how to integrate Gemini and structured together as well.  Creating a journal and notes section in the inbox. Learning about energy management and health over all.\nLooking forward to continue where i left off in\nmy custom designed structured planner.\nSet up Structured cloud in preparation of  going cross platform if need be.\n\n\n Proud pro user experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
