{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id601206182"}, "name":{"label":"woahchata"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-15T19:39:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14433129986"}, "title":{"label":"4 years and many more to come!"}, "content":{"label":"I first started using this app back in early 2022, and I haven't used another planner app since. It manages to be aesthetic and very useful at the same time! The developer was even kind enough to offer the pro version of this app for free if you sent an email explaining your situation (I was a broke high school student with ADHD, didn't take much to convince them there). I'm not sure if that's offered anymore, but I can confidently say that it's 100% worth your money. I would pay for the app now if I could. It continues to help me keep track of classes, appointments, workouts, etc. even in college. Thank you! ❤️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
